    "https://www.unh.edu/career/handshake": {
      "title": "Internships, Jobs and Volunteer Opportunities for Students & Alumni",
      "description": "Internships, Jobs and Volunteer Opportunities for Students & Alumni | Career and Professional Success Skip to main content University of New Hampshire Search Menu Search UNH.edu Search Career and Professional Success Search UNH.edu Search Search Commonly Searched Items: Handshake Wildcat Connections Career Events Career and Professional Success Students Make an Appointment Resources Jobs and Careers for Students Internships Internship Funding Opportunities Applying to Grad School Reserve an Interview Room Employers Recruiting Opportunities Partnerships & Sponsorships Submit Recruiting Survey Handshake for Employers Explore Internship Resources Become a Work Study Site Hire a UNH Law Student Review Policies Career Technology Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Career Events Career & Internship Fair Interview Days Industry-Specific Career Events Career Event Student Preparation Alumni Career Resources for Alumni Faculty & Staff Handshake for UNH Departments CaPS Information and Partnership Opportunities Faculty & Staff Employer Visit Request Resources for Advising Students About CaPS Meet the CaPS Team First Destination Survey Student Experience Survey Campus-2-Career Career Technology Internships, Jobs and Volunteer Opportunities for Students & Alumni In This Section Career Technology Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Internships, Jobs and Volunteer Opportunities for Students & Alumni Handshake is available for off-campus job, internship and volunteer opportunities, as well as events on campus, and career events: Search and apply for off-campus full-time jobs, internships and volunteer opportunities Learn about and attend career success events, programming, professional development opportunities, and recruiting events Handshake helps you connect with professional success! All UNH students have an account created for them upon enrollment at the university. This account can be accessed through UNH's unique link using the button below. Log in to Handshake Attention Incoming Students! An account will be created for you before the start of the fall semester. Please do not request an account over the summer. Email caps@unh.edu with any questions. Workday Career App is available for on-campus job and internship opportunities: Search and apply for on-campus jobs and internships Find information and support regarding work study eligibility, support for international students, and career coaching resources Workday Career App can be accessed via the button below. For questions or support please contact onboarding.team@usnh.edu or 603.862.2525 Workday Student Employment and Internships Set up your account Get started in Handshake Manage your profile Manage notifications \"How To\" Handshake Videos for Students Search for Positions in Handshake You can search for off-campus part-time jobs, full-time jobs, internships, and volunteer positions in Handshake. Positions are posted throughout the year, so continue to check Handshake! expand all Internships Log in to Handshake Go to Jobs at the top of your dashboard Click Internships to filter results View and apply to jobs! Off-Campus Jobs Log in to Handshake Go to Jobs at the top of your dashboard Click Full-time job or Part-time to filter results View and apply to jobs! Volunteer Positions Log in to Handshake Go to Jobs on the left in your dashboard Click Filters Select Volunteer Press Apply to view volunteer opportunities Please note: Handshake does not track volunteer hours. Please contact the volunteer organization for support. For Alumni For alumni who graduated after 2013 and still have access to their UNH email (@unh.edu, @wildcats.unh.edu, @usnh.edu), your Handshake account can be accessed via single sign on here: unh.joinhandshake.com/login If you no longer have access to your UNH email and graduated after 2013, you will need to request a Handshake account update here: unhcaps.info/requesthandshakeaccount . Select I am a UNH Alumni and complete the form in its entirety so our team can perform a Handshake account update. Please note, any Handshake requests via Handshake without a completed form will be denied. Employment Disclaimer for Students Career and Professional Success verifies all employers and job postings on Handshake through Handshake's Trust and Safety process; however, it is the responsibility of students and alumni to take necessary precautions when submitting personal information, interviewing, and accepting any type of position. Applicants should never provide their birth dates, Social Security numbers, credit card numbers, bank account information, or other private information when communicating with prospective employers or responding to online job opportunities. Career and Professional Success is not responsible for any other job board or means of employment that an applicant finds outside of Handshake. If you see a position in Handshake (or ANY job site) and/or receive an email from an employer that you believe may be a scam, please notify UNH Career and Professional Success immediately by calling 603-862-2070 or emailing caps@unh.edu , and we will look into the matter on your behalf. If you believe you are the victim of fraud resulting from a job listing, please contact UNH Police at (603) 862-1427. The Next Step Handshake Schedule an Appointment Reserve an Interview Room Hire a Wildcat CAPS by college College of Engineering and Physical Sciences College of Health and Human Services College of Liberal Arts College of Life Sciences and Agriculture College of Professional Studies Paul College of Business and Economics Copyright © 2026, University of New Hampshire. All rights reserved. TTY Users: 7-1-1 or 800-735-2964 (Relay NH) USNH Privacy Policies  • USNH Terms of Use  • Accessibility  • Statement of Nondiscrimination  • Jeanne Clery Act Contact Us Career and Professional Success Hood House 89 Main St. Durham, NH 03824 (603) 862-2070 caps@unh.edu @UNHCaPs Like us on Facebook Follow us on Twitter Follow us on LinkedIn Follow us on Instagram Career and Professional Success Students Show Students submenu Make an Appointment Resources Show Resources submenu Resumes Cover Letters References and Thank You Notes DIY Professional Headshot Photo Booth Campus Involvement Interview Skills Networking Show Networking submenu Informational Interviews Wildcat Way to Professional Success Your Pitch Workplace Safety Additional Resources Jobs and Careers for Students Internships Internship Funding Opportunities Applying to Grad School Reserve an Interview Room Employers Show Employers submenu Recruiting Opportunities Partnerships & Sponsorships Submit Recruiting Survey Handshake for Employers Explore Internship Resources Become a Work Study Site Hire a UNH Law Student Review Policies Career Technology Hide Career Technology submenu Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Career Events Show Career Events submenu Career & Internship Fair Show Career & Internship Fair submenu Employer Details Show Employer Details submenu Sponsorship Interview Days Industry-Specific Career Events Career Event Student Preparation Alumni Show Alumni submenu Career Resources for Alumni Faculty & Staff Show Faculty & Staff submenu Handshake for UNH Departments CaPS Information and Partnership Opportunities Faculty & Staff Employer Visit Request Resources for Advising Students About CaPS Show About CaPS submenu Meet the CaPS Team First Destination Survey Student Experience Survey Campus-2-Career Academics Show Academics submenu Explore Degree Programs Areas of Study Show Areas of Study submenu Certificate Programs Continuing Education Professional Development & Training Colleges & Schools Show Colleges & Schools submenu Carsey School of Public Policy College